{ Now I’d like to introduce you to a new type of tactical motif to consider – Trappable pieces. A trappable piece is one which has very few safe squares to run to and is typically of high value. After recognising a trappable piece in a puzzle or a game, you should identify all the safe squares it has and its possible escape routes. We should then look out for candidate moves that attack that piece and further limit its freedom. With that in mind, let’s work through a few more puzzles. }
1. -- *

