{ Pinned pieces are self-explanatory. Pinnable, Forkable and Skewerable pieces refer to pieces that have the potential to be pinned, forked, and skewered respectively.   Even if we cannot take advantage of these tactical motifs immediately, we should keep them in the back of our mind. In this way, we have more potential positional goals to work towards. Try the next few puzzles to develop a handle on these new tactical motifs. }
1. -- *

