2... Rxg1 3. Qxg1 { 3.Nxg1  Qg3+  4.Kh1  Qxf2  Winning a Rook } 3... Qg3+ 4.
Qxg3 hxg3+ 5. Kg2 gxf2+
{ In this puzzle, the tactic can only be solved with the help of the key squares, g2 and g3, and the key g-file. }
