[FEN "2kr3r/ppq2p2/4p3/4n3/3NQ3/P2P4/2P2PPP/R4RK1 b - - 0 1"]
[SetUp "1"]

1... Rxd4
{ An elegant puzzle with a straightforward solution. Once you are able to notice that  h2 is undefended, the rest is easy. Simply use reciprocal thinking to ask the right questions.   Q: How can we add more attackers to h2?    A: By getting our Knight out of the way, unleashing an attack on h2 from the c7 Queen.    Q: How do we get our Knight out of the way fast?    A: Nf3+.    Q:How does White defend?    A: Nxf3.    Q: How do we combat that defensive idea?    A: Rxd4 }
2. Qxd4 Nf3+ 3. gxf3 Qxh2# *

