{ You may recognise this position from Carlsen - Vachier-Lagrave in the 2021 Opera Euro rapid. Can you find the most direct win for Carlsen? }
1. Rc8
{ Short of time, Carlsen missed this move. However, with ample time, Carlsen would have, without a doubt, found this move through reciprocal thinking. The idea is to deflect the Rook from defending against Bd4#   1.Bd4+  was played in the game. This only wins back the exchange that White had sacrificed earlier  1...Rxd4  2.cxd4  White only has a small advantage here. Fortunately for Carlsen, he still managed to bring back the full point eventually. }
1... Rxc8 2. Bd4# *

[Event "?"]
