1... Rxa4
{ The most critical line to consider, since Black has just won the b5 square back. The problem is that the Rook on a4 will suffocate his own King later on.   1...Kd5  Black cannot run away  2.Rd7+  Kxe5  3.Bc3 }
2. Rc1+ { 2.Rc7+??  Kb5  And we cannot play Rb1+ } 2... Kb5
