13... Nxc2+ 14. Kf1 { 14.Kf2  is good too   14.Kd2??  Nxa1  15.h5  Qg5+ } 14...
Nxa1 15. h5 { Chasing the defender of f7 away } 15... Bb1 16. Nxf7
