1... Kc4 { Now Black is threatening ...Kb4 } 2. e4 { Planning to meet } 2...
Kb4 { with } 3. e5 { And the pattern repeats itself } 3... Kc5 4. a5 Kb5 5. e6
Kxa5 6. e7 *

