{ If the defender has his King in the ideal corner, he will have a perpetual check, with no fear of counter checks. }
1. Ke7 Qc5+ 2. Qd6 Qg5+ 3. Qf6 Qc5+ 4. Kf7 Qc7+ 5. Qe7 Qf4+
{ And White is not getting anywhere near to a counter-check so long as Black plays logically }
