50. Qg6+ Kg8 51. Qxc6 Rf6 52. Qe8+
{ Initially, it might seem that the Rook can oscillate between f6 and h6 indefinitely. But working through the three questions, we find that there is a way for White to force zugzwang. }
52... Kh7 53. Kxg4 Rh6 54. Kf4 Rf6 55. Ke5 Rh6 56. Qe6
{ Black cannot routinely play ...Rf6 because of Qxf6. ...Kh8 does not work either because of Qxh6, where White wins the resulting endgame }
56... Rf6
