{ As we have learnt in Chapter 4  (Essential Theoretical Endgames)  , memorising the winning/drawing methods and being familiar with evaluations of basic positions will help us steer unclear positions towards favourable ones. This is because we can effectively terminate our calculation the moment we arrive at a theoretical position within our repertoire of endgames.  In the following puzzles, we will practice applying the theoretical positions we have learnt from in the previous chapter. }
1. -- *

