[SetUp "1"]

1. Rc8+
{ Black's dark-squared Bishop cannot control the h1 corner. This means that White can draw if he trades his Rook and Bishop for Black's Rook and g7 pawn. }
1... Rf8 2. Rxf8+ Kxf8 3. Bh6 { threatening Bxg7 } 3... gxh6
{ With two rook pawns and the wrong Bishop, Black cannot win this one. } *

[Event "?"]
[Site "?"]
[Date "????.??.??"]
[Round "?"]
[White "5. Endgame Ideas"]
[Black "Puzzle #7"]
