[SetUp "1"]

1. Qxd4 exd4 2. e5
{ The e- and h-pawns are as far from each other as they are from the promotion rank. As we have learnt from the previous chapter, this means that they can queen on their own. All that is left is a quick calculation to see which side queens first. }
2... b5 3. e6
{ 3.e6  b4  4.e7  Kf7  5.h6  b3  6.h7  b2  7.e8=Q+  Kxe8  8.h8=Q+  White is one move faster }
