[SetUp "1"]

Kg8 { Stopping 2. Rh8 } 2. Rh5
{ White has no moves. All we need is a waiting move. } 2... Rg2
{ White must give up the Rook now. } 3. Rg5 fxg5+
{ Not   3...Rxg5??  Always watch out for stalemate! } *

